      {
        "text": "Generic retractable awning issue: Joints dry out and seize up without lubrication. Elbow joints and torque arms stiffen; movement becomes jerky, noisy, or stops altogether. Motors work harder than they should due to increased resistance from dry joints, which can trigger thermal shutdowns or shorten motor life",
        "kalla": {
          "domän": "marygrove.com",
          "url": "https://marygrove.com/retractable-awning-lubrication-maintenance-guide/"
        }
